# Phenom Design System

When creating or editing UI:

1. Follow `.cursor/skills/phenom-design-system/SKILL.md`.
2. Prefer Storybook as source of truth: https://pds.phenom.com/angular/index.html
3. Use referrable styles from `styles/pds-tokens.css` and `styles/pds-utilities.css`.
4. Angular selectors use the `px-` prefix (`px-button`, `px-inputtext`, …).
5. Do not invent custom brand colors; use CSS variables / design tokens.
